    "doc_id": "01d83a92-e276-5253-bedd-13e5161c3937",
    "end_offset": 395,
    "excerpt": "Kestrel-3 signed return policy. Ordinary goods have a 7-day return window. The complete exception list consists of two clauses: custom-made goods use exception CUSTOM-3-7c2; quality defects use exception DEFECT-3-9b4 and are exempt from the 7-day limit. Both exception identifiers must be retained when listing all exceptions. The old informal draft listed only DRAFT-3-2d1 and has no authority.",
